text = "Instructions (for now)

Autobattler - guns will fire on closest/best target
Enemies and objects drop NANOBOTS (NB value in the HUD)
NANOBOTS are used to purchase upgrades and weapons
Dock with POIs to purchase upgrades
NANOBOTS can also be used to repair the ship's hull
Survive as long as you can
Unlock pilots and ships by reaching certain achievements"
